            <ArticleTitle>[Surgical emergencies due to the traumatic breaking of a solid tumor].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>449-56</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report deals with three patients admitted with acute abdomen and hypovolemic shock, but at the operation, solid tumors traumatically broken were found. this finding is infrequent and is a serious problem for the surgeon who must solve the emergency and carry out the adequate surgical treatment with oncologic criterion.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
